                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamuya, kuti mutubuzizye kuliJehova, mebo abantu aba-Juda boonse, nkaambo kamajwi aabbuku eli ilyakajanika, nkaambo bwakomena bukali bwa-Jehova butubonekela, nkaambo bamatata teebakalemeka majwi aabbuku eli nikuba kucita zilembedwe aandiswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
