          "text": "Moyo wako wakabomba, alimwi wakalifwiinsya kubusyu bwa-Jehova nowakamvwa makani ngendakaamba aabusena obuno abantu bakede mulimbubo aakuti buyooba matongo aatukidwe, alimwi wakazapaula zyakusama zyako akulila kubusyu bwangu. Nkaambo kako ambebo ndaswiilila, mbwaamba Jehova. ",
